WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.950
Tom watched the horses gallop fast.

2
00:00:13.951 --> 00:00:17.615
His carriage flew over the ground.

3
00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:20.996
"My spell is working!" cried Tom.

4
00:00:20.997 --> 00:00:24.809
But Walter's swans were as fast as the horses.

5
00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.412
They bumped into Tom's carriage.

6
00:00:27.413 --> 00:00:34.157
Thump! Tom's carriage slowed down.

7
00:00:34.158 --> 00:00:36.678
"Oh no!" Tom cried.

8
00:00:36.679 --> 00:00:40.006
"Those swans knocked a wing off our carriage!"

9
00:00:40.007 --> 00:00:45.974
Walter and his king laughed as they flew by.

10
00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:48.976
"Cheaters!" Tom's king called.

11
00:00:48.977 --> 00:00:52.624
Tom's king was very upset. "Hurry, Tom!

12
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:55.073
Fix our carriage!"

13
00:00:55.074 --> 00:01:01.188
Tom waved his wand again and again.

14
00:01:01.189 --> 00:01:05.085
At last a huge wing appeared on the wheel.

15
00:01:05.086 --> 00:01:08.318
The other wing grew huge too.

16
00:01:08.319 --> 00:01:12.372
The carriage flew high in the air.

17
00:01:12.373 --> 00:01:16.745
The horses went up very high too.

18
00:01:16.746 --> 00:01:19.712
They could not gallop anymore.

19
00:01:19.713 --> 00:01:22.091
"Oops!" Tom said.

20
00:01:22.092 --> 00:01:26.500
Tom waved his wand again.

21
00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:32.158
The wings grew very small.

22
00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:35.958
Now they could not lift the carriage off the road.

23
00:01:35.959 --> 00:01:38.796
"Oops!" Tom said.

24
00:01:38.797 --> 00:01:46.822
All the other royal carriages raced past.

25
00:01:46.823 --> 00:01:50.179
Tom's king moaned.

26
00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:54.024
"We'll never win now!" he said.

27
00:01:54.025 --> 00:01:56.805
Tom sighed.

28
00:01:56.806 --> 00:02:00.744
He could see Walter's swans far ahead.

29
00:02:00.745 --> 00:02:03.957
They were almost at the finish line.

30
00:02:03.958 --> 00:02:07.079
"Walter's king will win," he said.

31
00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:12.414
Then Tom saw something else in the road.

32
00:02:12.415 --> 00:02:16.937
It was Cat!

